Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:12.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(724,818)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再过两分钟就好了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just two more minutes, Patrick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:15.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(932,164)}总入口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:15.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(890,628)}关
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.20,0:01:17.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:17.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:18.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:18.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.51,0:01:19.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:19.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here he comes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.33,0:01:22.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:22.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:23.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1108,808)}关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:24.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1108,808)}开
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.83,0:01:30.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你了  水母田管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:30.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Ranger
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.01,0:01:34.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:34.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.86,0:01:36.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是忘记什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:36.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.98,0:01:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.82,0:01:38.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:38.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请出示你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please show me your
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母执照
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing licenses
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星你看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, look
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.90,0:02:01.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我捉到了稀有品种  发光三点水母
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:02:01.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I caught a rare breed, a glowing three-spot
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.58,0:02:02.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也捉到了只
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:02.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I caught one too
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这只可是五点水母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This one's a five-spot
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你猜怎么着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, guess what
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你特别喜欢这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You like it here so much
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.62,0:02:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感动得想唱首歌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you feel yourself being moved to a song?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.77,0:02:15.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  你是怎么猜到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:15.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, how did you guess?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感觉到自己肚子在动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I kind of feel a movement coming on myself
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱就直接开始唱歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's just start with the song
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说水母歌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean the jellyfishing song?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.33,0:02:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这首
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来唱水母歌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I's the jellyfishing song
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起唱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing along
