Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing along
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.63,0:02:55.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我每天早上来捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:55.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I go jellyfishing in the morning
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.59,0:02:58.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我每晩都捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:58.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I jellyfish all the night
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.07,0:03:04.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每天下午都来捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:04.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing in the afternoon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母让我感觉好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing make me feel all right
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.31,0:03:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
