Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:25.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起唱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing along
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.89,0:03:32.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说棒不棒  这些壮丽无比的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:32.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great that these majestic creatures
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能把水母田当作家园
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have jellyfish fields to call their home?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.58,0:03:35.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:35.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You bet
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且这里离高速公路也很近
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's highway convenient too
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那大牌子上边写着的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,according to that big sign
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:43.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(884,258)}您正站在\N贝壳高速公路\N未来选址
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.28,0:03:39.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:39.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Big sign?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.92,0:03:40.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:40.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't see a--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.51,0:03:41.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的水母啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:41.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,jumping jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好大一个牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's a big sign
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面写着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it says
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.28,0:03:47.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贝壳高速公路未来选址
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:47.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"future site of the Shelly superhighway"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Superhighway?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道这什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟别的什么路差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it's sort of like other roads
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是没有停车标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,except there are no stop s--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.35,0:03:55.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道什么叫高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:55.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know what a superhighway is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我意思是对水母来说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean for all these jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对我们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for us
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对水母田来说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for jellyfish field
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.11,0:04:02.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:02.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你是想说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.79,0:04:06.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果规划顺利实行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:06.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is that if they go through with their plans
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.03,0:04:07.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功新建了这高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.03,0:04:07.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to build this new superhighway
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让它穿过水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,through jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.87,0:04:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么以此为栖息地的动植物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that every single specie of flora and fauna
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that makes this place their habitat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.47,0:04:17.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都将被迫迁离它们所形成的生态环境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:17.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will be forced out of the ecosystem they have formed
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从而迅速灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,effectively being destroyed?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,讲得还真是简短
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a simplified version
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过也差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but, yeah, something like that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此我特别在这庄严宣誓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which is why I hereby make this solemn vow
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.26,0:04:28.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阻止这所谓的贝壳高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:28.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to stop this so-called Shelly superhighway
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,动工建造
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from ever being built
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,1397
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1,397
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,1398
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1,398--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里  你得帮帮我阻止公路动工
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry, you got to help me stop the highway
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在没空  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't right now, bro
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.50,0:04:42.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还得举4098下才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:42.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got about 4,098 more reps to do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1126,634)}荫凉滩疗养院
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid man
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.68,0:04:52.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:52.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle boy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凭你们那样的超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Certainly with superpowers like yours
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就一定能阻止公路动工
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we can stop this superhighway
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:58.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,798)}冷漠
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我其实是想帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I actually would like to help
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是我现在太忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'm just too busy right now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忙着干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too busy doing what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我忙着跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy telling you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不帮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"no"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(681.958,216)}蟹堡王\N已服务超{\fnArial}2478921437{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}人次
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝二等兵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Private SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahoy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.13,0:05:25.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板上校好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:25.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Captain Mr. Krabs, ahoy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.05,0:05:29.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你平时敬礼可不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:29.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's not your usual four-fingered salute
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该是比较心烦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'm just upset
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为有条公路要动工了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because they're building a highway
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还要经过水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,over jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不想让客人看到你这副模样 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd sure hate me customers to see you like this
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.71,0:05:40.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以帮你什么忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:40.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to help?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了  何乐而不为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.30,0:05:46.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:46.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just know
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.34,0:05:48.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要团结起来就可以阻止那破烂公路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:48.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that together, we can stop that nasty old highway
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,径直穿过水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from going right through jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.14,0:05:55.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你该不会说的是贝壳高速公路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:53.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:55.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Shelly superhighway, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.98,0:05:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  因为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, 'cause
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我其实是支持公路建成的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm actually in favor of that highway being built
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.84,0:06:01.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:01.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.57,0:06:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经算出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've already calculated
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,建成之后会吸引多少新客人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how many new customers I'll get once it's finished
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.51,0:06:07.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以自己来看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:07.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can see for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:09.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,198)}贝壳高速公路
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.86,0:06:10.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一整套我挂出来的图表
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:08.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on this whole series of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,charts and diagrams I've displayed
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.95,0:06:11.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,图表
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:11.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Charts and dia--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  还看不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, didn't you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.99,0:06:15.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:15.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306,204)}规划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,778)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.97,0:06:18.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,规划写得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:18.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,According to this plan
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.34,0:06:21.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贝壳高速公路穿过水母田之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:19.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,after the Shelly superhighway
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:21.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,goes through jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会跳过蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it goes right over the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就在这  穷困潦倒地住在纸箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, destitute and living in a cardboard box
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后绕个大圈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then it does sort of a loop-the-loop
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,之后就会径直通往
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before going straight into the front door of
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.98,0:06:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海之霸大门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Chum Bucket
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:30.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(930,486)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.95,0:06:31.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:31.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁批准的这个规划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who approved this plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,批准者及赞助者为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Plan approved and sponsored
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿痞老板企业
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by Sheldon Plankton enterprises
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无趣股份有限公司旗下分公司
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a division of no fun incorporated"
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, lad
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.12,0:06:43.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们赶紧去痞老板一点颜色瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:43.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's go give that Plankton a piece of our minds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我这黄色行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think this piece will get the point across?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(476,680)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是尤金蟹  还有那个谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's Eugene Krabs here with what's-his-name
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, come on out
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没法出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给我出来面对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on outside and take what's coming to you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真的没法出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I really can't come outside
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我早就出来了  两个臭鱼烂虾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:04.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I'm already out here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:05.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you bumbling bottom-feeders
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行行好吧  睁大眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, for crying out loud
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想来这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, what's this all about, anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.12,0:07:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准给我们装蒜  小痞子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't play coy with us, Shelly
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们俩都知道你不安好心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We both know you've been up to no good
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快从实招来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, start talking
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.87,0:07:19.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:19.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.43,0:07:22.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我过去五年来一直在偷你邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:22.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so I've been stealing your mail for the past five years
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.23,0:07:22.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多大点事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:22.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,big whoop
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是这事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not that
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.15,0:07:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干啥了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've been what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们讲的是那条
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're talking about that
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.65,0:07:29.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你规划修建的新高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:29.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,new superhighway you're planning on building
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.38,0:07:30.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怕你不知道  我就告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:30.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in case you didn't know
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它会破坏水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's gonna destroy jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更不用说你那规划傻  还笨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that your plan is stupid and dumb
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又笨又傻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and dumb and stupid
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.28,0:07:37.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:37.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.87,0:07:38.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干啥了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:38.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've been what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一段有趣的长篇大论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly was
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an interesting series of words
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这么蹦过了你唇齿之间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that just tumbled out past your teeth and lips
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过老实说吧  我亲爱的海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but frankly, my dear sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't give a barnacle
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.59,0:07:50.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未必
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:50.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.61,0:07:51.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.45,0:07:55.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就算我想叫停贝壳高速公路动工
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:52.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if I wanted to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shelly superhighway from being built
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那也是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it would be impossible
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为全城都已经同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because the whole city has already approved it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.43,0:08:04.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己看这来得正是时候的回忆片段吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,through this conveniently timed flashback
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:08.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658,156)}裤头村市政厅及娱乐中心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:08.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,502)}今晚召开大会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(784,834)}市长
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肃静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保持会场肃静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order in the meeting hall
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.61,0:08:16.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在支持填平水母田者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:16.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, all those in favor of paving over jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及支持修建贝壳高速公路者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and building the Shelly superhighway
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,举起你们的右鳍喊赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,raise your right fin and say, "aye"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,若非支持者  请安静就座
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody else just sit there, quietly
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢公路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like highways
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.90,0:08:27.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢高速的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:27.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like things that are super
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢喊赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I like saying, "aye"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为什么要喊赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why did I say, "aye"?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,似乎喊赞成的占大多数
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seems as though the ayes have it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还得去筹备高速公路的事宜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got superhighway preparations to be attending to
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Toodles
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在要怎么办  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.97,0:08:47.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做出我唯一会做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:47.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna do the only thing I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来应对无法逾越的难关
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when me character is tested by insurmountable odds
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.07,0:08:54.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,躺平大声哭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:54.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lie on me back and sob loudly
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我平常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Normally, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然也会躺平大声哭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would lie on my back and sob loudly too
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.86,0:08:59.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是我绝对不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:08:59.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I am not giving up
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.32,0:09:01.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村还有一位居民
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:01.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's still one citizen in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.79,0:09:05.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会对这毫无仁义的事坐视不管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:02.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who won't sit still
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:05.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the face of this outrageous injustice
