Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(376,720)}贝壳高速公路\N就是高级
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.90,0:10:20.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是请给水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:20.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is give jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A chance
