Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大总裁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,CEOs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.67,0:10:26.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蜗牛脚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:26.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's toes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼鼻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's nose
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.75,0:10:28.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连裤袜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:28.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Panty hose
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.66,0:10:29.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摇摇椅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:29.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rocking chair
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.79,0:10:30.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗了穿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:30.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wash and wear
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.71,0:10:31.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空洞眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:31.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Empty stare
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.98,0:10:32.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海星毛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:32.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick's hair
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.67,0:10:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绿森林
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Green trees
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,松鼠蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy's fleas
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.00,0:10:35.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:35.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.88,0:10:36.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,柠檬片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:36.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lemon lime
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.92,0:10:37.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:37.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of time
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.96,0:10:38.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弯弯线
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:38.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squiggly line
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take a stand
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手拉手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.55,0:10:44.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想表达的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:44.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All we are trying to say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:42.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(990,784)}拯救水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:49.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1182,200)}报摊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.64,0:10:50.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是请给水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:50.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is give jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.81,0:10:54.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:54.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A chance
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.57,0:10:59.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有用了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:10:59.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's working, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.86,0:11:01.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙都在给公路喝倒彩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:01.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're booing the highway
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们的心声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like our message
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.70,0:11:04.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的开始传达到大众心中了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:04.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has really started getting through to the people
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁大众敞开心扉  咱们再来首歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's play another song while their hearts are open
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:13.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(250,686)}拯救水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.54,0:11:11.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我们的传单
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:11.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is one of our flyers
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.86,0:11:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们在拿我们自己的小册子扔我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're pelting us with our own pamphlets
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我告诉不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我告诉你们什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what it means
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means this
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.24,0:11:27.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思就是你们讨厌铃鼓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:27.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It means you hate tambourines?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错  意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it means--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.31,0:11:33.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是讨厌公路的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:33.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys the highway haters?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.14,0:11:34.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  可我们有正当理由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:34.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, but with good reason, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道吗  如果没有水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, without jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母就只能去找新家然后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,jellyfish will have to find a new home and--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.45,0:11:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you two, you're under arrest
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无证使用西塔琴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unlicensed use of a sitar
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这西塔琴是我奶奶给的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But my grandma gave me this sitar
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给的时候也没带证啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It didn't come with a license
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.28,0:11:48.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这玩意也没证
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:48.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, neither did this
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.20,0:11:57.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:57.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Highway
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:07.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366,668)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I'm scared
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.07,0:12:14.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记克利特斯叔公的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:14.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what my great-uncle Cletus said
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.14,0:12:17.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当时他在参加自由游行  之后被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:17.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,right before he was arrested during a freedom march
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.41,0:12:18.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:18.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游行就是一堆人在街上走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's where a bunch of people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,go walking down the street and--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.69,0:12:23.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道游行是什么  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:23.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know what a freedom march is, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想问他说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, what did he say?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.78,0:12:25.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:25.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  不要让你的心灵离你而去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said, "let not your heart walk away from you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.74,0:12:32.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以免你的理智亦步亦趋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:32.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,lest your mind grow legs and follow it"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.54,0:12:36.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有个天才叔公啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:36.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your uncle sounds like a pretty smart guy, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他被逮捕之后怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to him after he was arrested?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.43,0:12:39.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:39.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他从此杳无音讯了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was never heard from again
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  长发嬉皮士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later, longhairs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.89,0:12:55.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:55.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是假发
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a wig
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢载我们一程
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lift
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被丢在荒郊野岭里了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They left us in the middle of nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里不算荒郊野岭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't the middle of nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实是荒郊野岭的边上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're actually right on the edge of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:06.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,654)}正在进入荒郊野岭\N人口{\fnArial}0
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.07,0:13:07.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少没有下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:07.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it isn't raining
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:18.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1074,746)}拯救水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.17,0:13:22.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还没做好放弃的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:22.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to give up just yet
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.11,0:13:26.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是能想出更好的办法来传达给大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:25.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If we could just come up with a better way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to reach the people
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要能让大家都能看到跟听到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,something everybody can see and hear
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说游行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean like a parade?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.14,0:13:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A parade
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.95,0:13:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你怎么想出的这个金点子的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, how did you come up with such a brilliant idea?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.90,0:13:35.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边刚好有个走过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:35.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's one going by right there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,244)}贝壳高速公路
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是个游行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That certainly is a parade
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开着辆大拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,driving a big tractor
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.56,0:14:20.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况有点难看了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:20.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good at all, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.15,0:14:21.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个好看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:21.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go follow him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:32.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1168,596)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村的居民们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,People of bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.45,0:14:36.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听到那声没
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:36.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我又幻听了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm hearing the voices again
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.00,0:14:39.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:39.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.73,0:14:40.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:40.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up there
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.76,0:14:42.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天标志着一个新
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:42.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today marks a new--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.59,0:14:50.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别嘟囔了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:50.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop murmuring
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.64,0:14:52.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:52.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.53,0:14:56.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚说到  今天开启了一个全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.53,0:14:56.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, today marks the beginning of a new--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是个好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a jolly good fellow
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为他是个好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For he's a jolly good fellow
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.93,0:15:04.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:04.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天开启了裤头村的新时代
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today marks a new beginning for bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.70,0:15:15.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是时候铺开通往成功的大道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:15.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to pave our way down the road to success
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.34,0:15:36.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱这清晨的热柏油味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:36.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love the smell of hot tar in the morning
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是不是想让自己被压扁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get yourself crushed?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会让你这么干的  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do it, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果你要填平水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna pave over jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就必须先从我身上压过去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're gonna have to pave over me first
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.75,0:16:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就恭敬不如从命了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command, sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.96,0:16:12.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就这点本事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:12.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别闹了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Patrick
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:38.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,202)}贝壳高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314,488)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从前一直在幻想我的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I used to dream of me restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能够与公路近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,having easy highway access
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊  不过这更像是近过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but this is more like highway excess
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.53,0:16:54.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要去泡泡我的爪子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:54.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna go soak my tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这混凝土底下冷得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's cold in here under all this concrete
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是章鱼哥  我们不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Squidward, you can't leave
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.89,0:17:00.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一我们来客人了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:17:00.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if we have a customer?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.61,0:17:05.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自从公路建成  连半个客人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:02.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a customer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:05.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since the day this highway was built
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  严格来说这是高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, it's technically a superhighway
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.35,0:17:09.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不管这什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:09.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.11,0:17:09.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:09.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Squidward--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.69,0:17:11.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:11.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别说了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.19,0:17:16.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看是时候该接受事实了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:16.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think it's high time we started accepting facts
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.39,注释,,0,0,0,,[ fax（传真）与 fact（事实）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来搞定  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not that kind
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.78,0:17:22.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你说的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:22.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王无法营业下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab can't stay in business
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not like this
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.33,0:17:27.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:27.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It can't?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.54,0:17:33.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是时候实行z-99计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:33.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time to activate plan zed dash niner niner
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.23,0:17:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,z-99
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,z-99
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金  z-99计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene, what is plan zed dash niner niner?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更重要的是  对我有何影响
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, how does it affect me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.16,0:17:45.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,z-99计划就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:45.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plan zed dash niner niner is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.71,0:17:48.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:48.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.40,0:17:50.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:50.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把蟹黄堡的秘密配方卖给痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm selling the Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,secret formula to Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.55,0:17:58.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:58.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no choice
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.11,0:17:59.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也别叫我尤金了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:17:59.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And stop calling me Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.09,0:18:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快说我在做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me that I'm dreaming
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并没有  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not this time, little fella
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(694,788)}开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:06.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(694,788)}关
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lower
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再低一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A little lower
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.01,0:18:22.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是谁胆敢闯进我的成功时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:22.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, who could that be during my hour of triumph?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时间真是刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How appropriate
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.60,0:18:26.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:26.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.31,0:18:29.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好跟你协商秘方的价钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:29.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to negotiate a price for me secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.37,0:18:30.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:30.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, goody
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我给手表上个发条
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me just wind my watch
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.48,0:18:37.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我要好好享受接下来的每一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:37.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm gonna love every minute of this
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.70,0:18:39.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:39.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.26,0:18:41.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在那上面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:41.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up there
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Nelly
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.81,0:18:50.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先是失去了水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:50.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First I lost jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.21,0:18:51.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:51.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.52,0:18:56.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:56.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and what?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.46,0:19:01.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后我失去了我唯一想要的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:01.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I've lost the only job I ever wanted
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从这个角度看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at it this way
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.07,0:19:06.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没必要每天都看到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:06.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have to see you every day now
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.02,0:19:09.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可能就是美好的开端了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:09.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This really could be the start of something beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.75,0:19:11.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这到底是在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:11.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the name of--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, look
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.06,0:19:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看什么看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I looking--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从前栖息在水母田里的所有水母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All the jellyfish who used to live in jellyfish fields
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都涌进裤头村了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are coming to bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是  可是不知为何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but for some reason
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.45,0:19:24.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得它们不是来送礼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:24.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's to distribute holiday gift baskets
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.24,0:19:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.88,0:19:35.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:35.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方的事以后再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's just talk about this later
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.53,0:19:39.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看我还是逃命要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.53,0:19:39.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I'm just gonna run for me life
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.92,0:19:41.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:41.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别蛰眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.23,0:19:53.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村已经陷入混乱之中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:53.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chaos runs rampant in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是的  各位观众
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里是记者本布伦尼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is news reporter Ben blenny
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为帕奇帕金斯代班
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,standing in for perch Perkins
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.15,0:20:00.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他今天因消化不良而请病假
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:20:00.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who's out today with a terrible case of indigestion
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.41,0:20:01.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们将为您现场直播
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.41,0:20:01.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And we are coming to you live
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.69,0:20:03.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村遭遇浩劫的第三天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,during day three
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of what appears to be bikini bottom's worst--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我上电视了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Am I on television?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.78,0:20:06.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是的先生  您上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:06.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, you are
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.82,0:20:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能否评价此次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you care to say a few words--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.95,0:20:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, mom
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, dad
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.03,0:20:10.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,斯利恩医生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.03,0:20:10.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dr. Sleen
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍妮弗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jennifer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.25,0:20:11.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,萨莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:11.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sally
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.04,0:20:12.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:12.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Francis
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.87,0:20:13.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梅布尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:13.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mabel
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.80,0:20:14.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朱莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Julie
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Abigail
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家不得不听了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now they'll have to listen
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有我在阿尔图纳的好哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And there's my pals in altoona
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有在帕吉夫利珀的兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the gang at the pudgy flipper
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.86,0:20:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, little boy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是否可以对着镜头评价当前危急形势
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:27.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how about saying a few words
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:29.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,into the camera about the current crisis?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉我有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm a little nervous
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.69,0:20:34.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:34.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's understandable
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.46,0:20:35.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要你说清楚就行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:35.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just talk nice and clear
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, I guess
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I have to say
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is that, um
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大概是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That probably--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要胡闹下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,stop the madness
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.13,0:20:49.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要把水母田归还给水母们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:49.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need to give jellyfish fields back to the jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.17,0:20:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果恢复了它们的自然栖息地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If we restore their natural habitat
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们就会平静地离去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,then they will go in peace
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.04,0:20:57.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的家园就会再次恢复平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:57.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and balance will once again be restored to our land
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.55,0:20:58.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以大家觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.55,0:20:58.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, everybody?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.88,0:20:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们会帮我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:20:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.42,0:21:01.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:01.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.19,0:21:02.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们逗我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.19,0:21:02.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.27,0:21:04.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:04.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody, follow me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.31,0:21:12.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  各位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:12.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.77,0:21:17.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟裤头村史上最大的浩劫说声再见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:15.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,say good-bye to the worst thing to happen to this town
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since 97¢ stores
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个白费力气  海绵笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good effort, spongedope
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜你拆不掉我的公路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you can't tear up my highway
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它坚不可摧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's indestructible
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.53,0:21:31.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要我们献出一份力就行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:31.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not if we have anything to do with it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,龙虾拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry lobster
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.91,0:21:34.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不止呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but that's not all
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,松鼠珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy squirrel
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.25,0:21:44.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:44.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid man and barnacle boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没了  都来齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope, that's everybody
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.29,0:21:55.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,推
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:55.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Push
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.02,0:21:58.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:21:58.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Harder
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.71,0:22:03.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:03.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Harder still
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.38,0:22:05.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听见那小方块说的话了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:05.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You heard the little square guy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.32,0:22:12.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:12.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.03,0:22:14.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没想到你们都会团结起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:14.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't count on all of you working together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的公路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My highway
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.59,0:22:18.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:18.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.43,0:22:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赞美海神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.43,0:22:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Praise Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.68,0:22:33.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:33.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来唱水母歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the jellyfishing song
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.68,0:22:37.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:37.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.81,0:22:39.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起唱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.81,0:22:39.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing along
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.73,0:22:41.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.73,0:22:41.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来唱水母歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the jellyfishing song
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母无忧无虑  水母快乐无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jelly lelly lelly jelly, jelly lelly lelly jelly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.77,0:22:55.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:55.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone sing
